
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@facilityId = {{createdFacilityId}}

### 1. CREATE FACILITY PRICE

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/facility-prices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityId": {{facilityId}},
  "price": 500.00,
  "validFrom": "2026-11-10",
  "validTo": "2027-12-31"
}

###

### 2. GET FACILITY PRICE HISTORY

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/facility-prices/facility/{{facilityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. GET FACILITY PRICE FOR DATE

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/facility-prices/facility/{{facilityId}}/date/2026-11-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
